<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH REPUBLIC AND NETHERLANDS LEVEL 1-1 IN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH REPUBLIC AND NETHERLANDS LEVEL 1-1 IN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech Republic and</p>
<p>Netherlands were level 1-1 after the opening singles matches in</p>
<p>their Fed Cup semifinal on Saturday:</p>
<p>Results:</p>
<p>Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Sandra Kleinova</p>
<p>(Czech Republic) 6-1 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Jana Novotna (Czech Republic) beat Miriam Oremans (Netherlands)</p>
<p>6-3 6-0</p>
</text>
